{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>The abomination of Egypt.</b> The fear of Egypt — as in ״וּלְמִלְכֹּם תּוֹעֲבַת בְּנֵי עַמּוֹן״ (II Kings 23:13), and concerning Israel he calls it תּוֹעֵבָה. And further, one may say in another sense: <b>the abomination of Egypt</b> — a thing hated by Egypt is the slaughter that we slaughter, for their fear is what we slaughter." "<b>And they will not stone us.</b> With astonishment."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:51:08.102354072Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}